{"4970350":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"KIBAKI !","steam_appid":4970350,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4971430],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of KIBAKI!<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KIBAKI! is a strategic card game where every match becomes a battle of prediction, anticipation, and collection.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with the eight classic cards, build your deck, and discover a growing universe filled with creatures known as <strong>Virtuamon<\/strong>.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR STRATEGY<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision can turn the tide of a match.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with the 8 classic cards.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge the computer or other players.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anticipate your opponent's choices.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Instant cards to turn a match around.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop new strategies with every game.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPAND YOUR COLLECTION<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Virtuamon Laboratory<\/strong> allows you to build an ever-growing collection.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open packs, discover new Virtuamon, collect Potions, and unlock powerful evolutions. Experiment with different combinations and build decks that match your playstyle.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER KIBAKI!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KIBAKI! combines simple rules with prediction, deck building, collection, and progression.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the basics in minutes, develop your own strategies, expand your collection, and challenge your opponents as you explore everything the KIBAKI! universe has to offer.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of KIBAKI!<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KIBAKI! is a strategic card game where every match becomes a battle of prediction, anticipation, and collection.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with the eight classic cards, build your deck, and discover a growing universe filled with creatures known as <strong>Virtuamon<\/strong>.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR STRATEGY<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision can turn the tide of a match.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with the 8 classic cards.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge the computer or other players.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anticipate your opponent's choices.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Instant cards to turn a match around.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop new strategies with every game.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPAND YOUR COLLECTION<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Virtuamon Laboratory<\/strong> allows you to build an ever-growing collection.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open packs, discover new Virtuamon, collect Potions, and unlock powerful evolutions. Experiment with different combinations and build decks that match your playstyle.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER KIBAKI!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KIBAKI! combines simple rules with prediction, deck building, collection, and progression.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the basics in minutes, develop your own strategies, expand your collection, and challenge your opponents as you explore everything the KIBAKI! universe has to offer.<\/p>","short_description":"KIBAKI! is a strategic card game of prediction, collection, and evolution. Master 8 classic cards, outsmart rivals with Instant cards, build your deck, and expand your Virtuamon collection through packs, potions, and powerful evolutions.","supported_languages":"French","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\